    "_comment": [
      "Blank means unknown, and unknown is what a template knows about someone",
      "it has never met. These fields used to carry instructions as values \u2014",
      "'Your Name', 'City, State', 'US Citizen | Green Card | F1 OPT | H1B' \u2014",
      "and nothing downstream could tell an instruction from an answer. The",
      "wizard pre-filled 'City, State' into the location box and left Continue",
      "enabled, so agreeing with the form recorded a location that does not",
      "exist. Everything a resume states is filled in by derive_personal_info();",
      "what is left is what the About-you screen asks."
    ]
